1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,010
A Report on the Used Book Collection Project
关于旧书回收活动的报告

2
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:10,810
Recently, a used book collection project was carried out on our campus.
最近，我们校园里开展了一次旧书回收活动。

3
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:15,170
As a volunteer, I would like to give a brief report on it.
作为一名志愿者，我想就这次活动做一个简要的报告。

4
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:20,840
The project was organized by the student union together with the university library.
这次活动由学生会和学校图书馆联合组织。

5
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:25,880
Its aim was to give used books a second life and to help children in need.
活动的目的是让旧书重获新生，并帮助有需要的孩子。

6
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:33,870
Students and teachers from all departments were invited to take part, and more than two hundred volunteers helped with the work.
各院系的老师和学生都受邀参加，二百多名志愿者帮助完成了这项工作。

7
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,620
The activities lasted two weeks.
活动持续了两周。

8
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:48,700
During the first week, collection boxes were placed in every dormitory building and in the library, and volunteers went from room to room to collect textbooks, novels and reference books.
第一周，每栋宿舍楼和图书馆里都放置了回收箱，志愿者们挨个寝室去收集教材、小说和参考书。

9
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:54,160
In the second week, the volunteers sorted the books into different categories.
第二周，志愿者们把书分成了不同的类别。

10
00:00:54,960 --> 00:01:03,070
The books were then sold cheaply at a campus book fair, and all the money raised was donated to a charity that supports disadvantaged children.
随后，这些书在校园书市上低价出售，筹集到的钱全部捐给了一家帮助贫困儿童的慈善机构。

11
00:01:03,870 --> 00:01:05,670
The project was a great success.
这次活动非常成功。

12
00:01:06,470 --> 00:01:12,230
It not only put unused books to good use but also showed participants how they could serve others.
它不仅让闲置的书得到了充分利用，还让参与者明白了如何为他人服务。
